# BackSpace sends what the host's setting chooses, BS (0x08) or DEL (0x7f),
# alone and with Shift, Alt and Ctrl, as ctlseqs' Backarrow key gives.
# spec: ctlseqs, PC-Style Function Keys and the Backarrow key; INTERFACE-vtium.md, The BackSpace key
# covers: input.legacy
size 8 1
key BackSpace
key BackSpace mods=shift
key BackSpace mods=alt
key BackSpace mods=ctrl
key BackSpace mods=ctrl+alt
backspace del
key BackSpace
key BackSpace mods=shift
key BackSpace mods=alt
key BackSpace mods=ctrl
key BackSpace mods=ctrl+alt
